+
+// Separate activation resources, never borrowed from the canonical KV account.
+// Admission covers input + complete projection + output tapes simultaneously,
+// and one bounded pinned transfer buffer. The selected tape tier is private to
+// this execution; it cannot race another request's activation reservations.
